":"2026 season stats","news":[{"headline":"Pawn shop fighting 'Gold Digger' trademark filed by Jordon Hudson's company","description":"A California pawn shop is opposing a trademark application for \"Gold Digger\" filed by a company connected to Jordan Hudson, then-companion of Bill Belichick.","published":"2026-11-17T23:16:13.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/espn/story/_/id/50514442/pawn-shop-fights-gold-digger-trademark-filed-hudson","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Anthony Olivieri","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Oklahoma coach Venables shouts out Love's after Buc-ee's comment","description":"Venables showed love Sunday to Buc-ee's -- which is owned by an alumnus of the Sooners' next opponent, Texas A&M. So on Tuesday the coach repped the Oklahoma-based Love's.","published":"2026-11-17T22:23:36.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50513199/oklahoma-brent-venables-loves-travel-stop","type":"Story","byline":"J.J. Post","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"2026 college football coaching carousel: Tracking every open job","description":"As the carousel spins, we'll keep you updated with all the comings and goings.","published":"2026-11-17T21:26:31.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50358611/2026-cfb-coaching-carousel-firings-hirings","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"North Texas QB Tayven Jackson out with upper-body injury","description":"North Texas senior quarterback Tayven Jackson, who is sixth in the FBS with 3,005 passing yards, will miss at least the next two games with an upper-body injury.","published":"2026-11-17T20:53:17.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50513204/north-texas-qb-tayven-jackson-upper-body-injury","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Defiant Dabo Swinney says Clemson's 'gonna win a bunch more'","description":"Despite going through a self-described \"rough patch\" over the past two seasons, Clemson coach Dabo Swinney is resolute in his belief that he and the Tigers have a lot more wins ahead of them.","published":"2026-11-17T20:37:09.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50512833/defiant-dabo-swinney-says-clemson-gonna-win-bunch-more","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Andrea Adelson","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Sources: Army OC Cody Worley to be Furman head coach","description":"Army offensive coordinator Cody Worley is expected to be the next head coach at Furman, sources told ESPN.","published":"2026-11-17T20:11:06.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50512672/army-oc-worley-furman-head-coach","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Pete Thamel","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Former Iowa State AD calls NIL system 'money laundering'","description":"Former Iowa State athletic director Jamie Pollard delivered a scorching appraisal of college athletics to the Knight Commission, equating NIL as a money-laundering operation.","published":"2026-11-17T19:08:48.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-sports/story/_/id/50512485/former-iowa-state-ad-calls-nil-system-money-laundering","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Purdue rolls with FAA ground stop by taking buses to Iowa","description":"Unable to travel by plane, the Boilermakers rolled with the situation and found some good times on the way.","published":"2026-11-17T11:28:30.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50504665/purdue-faa-ground-stop-bus-iowa","type":"Story","byline":"Adam Rittenberg","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Heisman of Week 11: Duke's Nate Sheppard has entered the running","description":"In a season in which star running backs seem to be popping up out of nowhere, the Blue Devils' sophomore stands out.","published":"2026-11-17T14:55:53.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50503621/heisman-watch-week-11-duke-nate-sheppard","type":"Story","byline":"Bill Connelly","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Who's on College Football Playoff bubble ahead of committee's third ranking?","description":"A conference-by-conference look at which teams are contending for the playoff, who's close and who's out.","published":"2026-11-17T22:28:22.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50503628/cfp-playoff-2026-bubble-watch-week-third-ranking","type":"Story","byline":"Heather Dinich","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5146422/xavier-gilliam","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Xavier_Gilliam"},"pick":{"pick":17,"round":1,"team":"SEA","provisional":false},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Xavier Gilliam","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Xavier_Gilliam","description":"American football player","touched":"2026-11-14T07:38:11Z","intro":"Xavier Harold Gilliam is an American football defensive tackle for the Tennessee Volunteers. He previously played for the Penn State Nittany Lions.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Gilliam attended Wilde Lake High School in Columbia, Maryland and Quince Orchard High School in Gaithersburg, Maryland. He committed to play college football for the Penn State Nittany Lions over offers from Boston College, Maryland, Ole Miss, Texas A&M, West Virginia, and Virginia Tech."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"As a freshman at Penn State in 2024, Gilliam was redshirted. During the 2025 season, he appeared in 13 games with two starts, totaling 15 tackles with two for loss, a forced fumble, and a blocked field goal. After the conclusion of the season, Gilliam entered the NCAA transfer portal.\nGilliam transferred to play for the Tennessee Volunteers. In the 2026 season opener, he posted six tackles with five for loss, and three sacks in a win over Furman."}]}}